    "上下文窗口和单次输出上限均直接使用这里填写的数值，不再由 Auralis 额外设置固定上限。默认仍为 256K / 16K；可按模型实际能力填写更大的数值。最终可用范围由所连接模型或 API 服务端决定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Context window and per-request output limit use the values you enter directly, without an additional hard limit from Auralis. Defaults remain 256K / 16K; enter larger values according to your model’s actual capabilities. The final usable range is determined by the connected model or API service."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上下文視窗和单次输出上限均直接使用这里填写的数值，不再由 Auralis 额外設定固定上限。默认仍为 256K / 16K；可按模型实际能力填写更大的数值。最终可用范围由所连接模型或 API 服务端决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
